#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:5
#: 9cbf55e770664dacbd7ea0150bc7d966
msgid "Archived: Building ArduPilot for APM2.x with Eclipse on Windows"
msgstr "已归档：在 Windows 上使用 Eclipse 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:9
#: 55c135809a1a4ffcbc9e48fe50ebe337
msgid ""
"This topic is archived because APM2.x is no longer a supported autopilot "
"(since AC3.2.1). The information may still be relevant if attempting to use "
"Eclipse for Pixhawk or other autopilots."
msgstr ""
"本主题已归档，因为 APM2.x 自 AC3.2.1 起不再是受支持的飞控。如果尝试对 Pixhawk 或其他飞控使用 "
"Eclipse，该信息可能仍然适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:13
#: 4cc52f76922b43fb9845002a164a908d
msgid ""
"This article shows how to build ArduPilot for APM2.x on Windows using the "
"Eclipse IDE."
msgstr "本文介绍如何在 Windows 上使用 Eclipse IDE 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:17
#: 51aa1fd06c59474c90dd5abf982e83dd
msgid ""
"These instructions show to use *Eclipse Luna* from the *PX4 Toolchain* to "
"build for APM2.x targets. They have been tested by building the "
"*ArduCopter-3.2.1* branch on Windows 10."
msgstr ""
"本说明介绍如何使用 *PX4 Toolchain* 中的 *Eclipse Luna* 为 APM2.x 目标进行构建。已在 Windows 10 "
"上通过构建 *ArduCopter-3.2.1* 分支进行了测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:22
#: ce1ff7cbad034554ad09a7f567e7970e
msgid ""
"Copter 3.3 firmware (and later) and builds after Plane 3.4.0 no longer fit "
"on APM2.x boards. Plane, Rover and AntennaTracker builds can still be "
"installed at time of writing but you can no longer build APM2.x off the "
"master branch (you will need to build off a supported release branch)."
msgstr ""
"Copter 3.3 固件（及更高版本）以及 Plane 3.4.0 之后的构建不再适合 APM2.x 开发板。撰写本文时，Plane、Rover 和 "
"AntennaTracker 的构建仍可安装，但您不能再从 master 分支构建 APM2.x（您需要从受支持的发布分支构建）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:24
#: a5ea9773586a4528930b4c4cf16dfa48
msgid ""
"The last Copter firmware that can be built on APM 2.x `can be downloaded "
"from here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/archive/master-"
"AVR.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"可在 APM 2.x 上构建的最后一个 Copter 固件 `可从此处下载 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/archive/master-AVR.zip>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:27
#: 3ea7d75e274843b694fbdd085ecb4371
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:29
#: 47fd8057b34b4227afa8092561529f32
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in :ref:`Building ArduPilot for APM2.x on Windows "
"with Make <building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make>`. These show "
"how to download the source code, install the needed tools (including "
"Eclipse) and how to set up the environment."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`Building ArduPilot for APM2.x on Windows with Make <building-"
"ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make>` 中的说明操作。这些说明介绍了如何下载源代码、安装所需工具（包括 "
"Eclipse）以及设置环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:33
#: 0a74301f6b834bc59af951456526d499
msgid ""
"Make sure you update the **config.mk** with the location of your ARDUINO "
"tools."
msgstr "确保用 ARDUINO 工具的位置更新 **config.mk**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:36
#: 6fc73d1b2323417dacda5242188fcf18
msgid "Starting Eclipse"
msgstr "启动 Eclipse"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:38
#: c81776b923724f52a8bb01ed1f66c3ca
msgid ""
"Start Eclipse using the *PX4 Eclipse* link installed with the *PX4 "
"toolchain*. The link can be accessed from either:"
msgstr "使用随 *PX4 toolchain* 安装的 *PX4 Eclipse* 链接启动 Eclipse。该链接可从以下位置访问："

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:40
#: 58936c60231a4332b6f17927fcb4a77b
msgid ""
"The Windows Start menu (**Start \\| All Programs \\| PX4 Toolchain \\| PX4 "
"Eclipse**), or"
msgstr ""
"Windows 开始菜单（**Start \\| All Programs \\| PX4 Toolchain \\| PX4 Eclipse**），或"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:41
#: e93535638ed8490a8c28323097de77e9
msgid "You can directly run the file **C:\\\\px4\\\\toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0\\\\px4_eclipse.bat**"
msgstr "可直接运行文件 **C:\\\\px4\\\\toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0\\\\px4_eclipse.bat**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:44
#: 0c88c86e7e5c4b388cad5f200e695c76
msgid "Creating the Project"
msgstr "创建项目"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:46
#: 2164283e19324246a3817ec633a2ff58
msgid "Create the project:"
msgstr "创建项目："

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:48
#: 818cd92ee4844f338bad89bd9907e46a
msgid "Select **File \\| New \\| Make Project with Existing Code**"
msgstr "选择 **File \\| New \\| Make Project with Existing Code**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:49
#: 88069416015e445ebf7fca8801dee3c6
msgid ""
"Fill in the Project Name and set the *Existing Code Location* to the Copter "
"directory"
msgstr "填写项目名称并将 *Existing Code Location* 设置为 Copter 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:50
#: bb60bdfe9ca04885ac4abca1d5300257
msgid "Set the Toolchain to be *Cross GCC*\" and press **Finish**"
msgstr "将工具链设置为 *Cross GCC*，然后点击 **Finish**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:56
#: e29e9ebc99e841a5af15e3895e449e62
msgid "Use spaces instead of tabs"
msgstr "使用空格代替制表符"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:58
#: b4f1065b39564521bc14130db2391c3f
msgid ""
"By default Copter, Plane and Rover use spaces in place of tabs. This can be "
"set to the default in Eclipse by changing two settings:"
msgstr "默认情况下 Copter、Plane 和 Rover 使用空格代替制表符。可在 Eclipse 中通过修改两个设置将此设为默认值："

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:60
#: 1f6db60262634e9893bc7a0dc7ef3a5e
msgid ""
"Select **Window \\| Preferences \\| General \\| Editors \\| Text Editors \\|"
" Insert spaces for tabs**."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Window \\| Preferences \\| General \\| Editors \\| Text Editors \\| "
"Insert spaces for tabs**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:66
#: 01bc80f5dcef48b1a6a13cb91b550d0b
msgid ""
"Select **Windows \\| Preferences \\| C/C++ \\| Code Style \\| Formatter** "
"and creating a new Profile (i.e. \"K&R Tab\") which has the \"Indentation\" "
"set to \"Spaces only\""
msgstr ""
"选择 **Windows \\| Preferences \\| C/C++ \\| Code Style \\| Formatter** "
"并创建新配置文件（例如「K&R Tab」），将「Indentation」设为「Spaces only」"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:72
#: dc1e7588e0834a6e81280a8a5fba7da1
msgid "Specify build location"
msgstr "指定构建位置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:74
#: 521251ad0c1d413aa427af8d711aa440
msgid ""
"In the *Project Explorer* right-mouse-click on the ardupilot folder and "
"select **Properties**. Then under C/C++ Build set the \"Build location\" to "
"the Copter or Plane directory as shown below."
msgstr ""
"在 *Project Explorer* 中右键单击 ardupilot 文件夹，选择 **Properties**。然后在 C/C++ Build "
"下将「Build location」设置为如下所示的 Copter 或 Plane 目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:80
#: dcd63e02bef340dc842a65def66cf595
msgid "Specify make target"
msgstr "指定 make 目标"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:82
#: 79c3b272460841a2a5802769cebd12ee
msgid ""
"In the Make window on the right create, specify an ``apm2`` make target as "
"shown:"
msgstr "在右侧的 Make 窗口中创建一个 ``apm2`` make 目标，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:87
#: e4312f6c716341c5a56ea72264527dc7
msgid "Eclipse: Setting the apm2 maketarget"
msgstr "Eclipse：设置 apm2 make 目标"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:90
#: 26e93312c06d4145ab8cf7e21c02751a
msgid "Building from Eclipse"
msgstr "从 Eclipse 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:92
#: 342339badf1e46f5958f5691d7c19baf
msgid ""
"The make target can be built by pushing the green circle + hammer icon. The "
"build progress will appear in the Console window."
msgstr "可通过点击绿色圆圈加锤子图标来构建 make 目标。构建进度将显示在 Console 窗口中。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:98
#: b8a6af5dbc31421790461381fdc994cb
msgid "Eclipse: Building APM2"
msgstr "Eclipse：构建 APM2"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows.rst:100
#: 5e72392915df4a7b9a69584024c1a393
msgid ""
"The firmware will be created in a subfolder of the user’s temp directory. "
"For example you will find **ArduCopter.hex** in **C:\\\\Users\\\\\\ "
"**YourUserNameHere**\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\ArduCopter.build**."
msgstr ""
"固件将创建在用户临时目录的子文件夹中。例如，您会在 **C:\\\\Users\\\\\\ "
"**YourUserNameHere**\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\ArduCopter.build** 中找到 "
"**ArduCopter.hex**。"
